  "meta": {
    "title": "w c wᴿ: a palindrome with its middle marked",
    "blurb": "Push until the c, then pop against the rest. The marker is what makes this deterministic: without it the machine has to guess where the middle is, and the even palindromes are not a deterministic context-free language at all.",
